        "S007"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P021",
      "The following are used to alert personnel to procedures which require special attention, to those which",
      false,
      "prose",
      "3:column:2",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P022",
      "could damage equipment, and to those which could be dangerous to personnel:",
      false,
      "prose",
      "3:column:3",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P023",
      "SELF-PRIMING CENTRIFUGAL PUMPS",
      true,
      "heading",
      "4:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P024",
      "This information applies to G-R SelfPriming Centrifugal pumps.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S009"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P025",
      "These\npumps are available as basic, pedestalmounted models or as close-coupled\nmodels driven by either an electric motor, gasoline or diesel engine.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S009"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P026",
      "Refer to\nthe manual accompanying the power\nsource before attempting to begin operation.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S009"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P027",
      "This manual will alert personnel to\nknown procedures which require special attention, to those which could\ndamage equipment, and to those which\ncould be dangerous to personnel.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S009"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P028",
      "However,thismanualcannot possiblyanticipate and provide detailed instructions\nand precautions for every situation that\nmight occur during maintenance of the\nunit.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S009"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P029",
      "Therefore, it is the responsibility of\nthe owner/maintenance personnel to\nensure that only safe, established maintenance procedures are used, and that\nany procedures not addressed in this\nmanual are performed only after establishing that neither personal safety nor\npump integrity are compromised by\nsuch practices.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S009"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P030",
      "In addition to this manual, see the separate literature covering maintenance\nandrepair,pump parts,and anyoptional\nequipment shipped with the pump.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S009"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P031",
      "Before attempting toopenor service the\npump:",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S009"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P032",
      "1. Familiarize yourself with this manual.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S009"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P033",
      "2. Disconnect or shut down the power source and take necessary precautions to ensure that the pump\nwill remain inoperative.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S009"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P034",
      "3. Allow the pump to completely cool\nif overheated.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S009"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P035",
      "SAFETY",
      true,
      "heading",
      "4:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S009"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P036",
      "OM--04760",
      true,
      "heading",
      "4:column:1",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P037",
      "4. Check the temperature before\nopening any covers, plates, or\nplugs.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:1",
      null,
      [
        "S011"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P038",
      "5. Close the suction and discharge\nvalves.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:1",
      null,
      [
        "S011"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P039",
      "6. Vent the pump slowly and cautiously.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:1",
      null,
      [
        "S011"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P040",
      "7. Drain the pump.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:1",
      null,
      [
        "S011"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P041",
      "Do not attempt to pump any liquids the\npump has not been designed for, and\nwhich may damage the pump or endanger personnel as a result of pump failure.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:1",
      null,
      [
        "S011"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P042",
      "Consult the factory to determine\ncompatibilitybetweenthe pump andliquid.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:1",
      null,
      [
        "S011"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P043",
      "Use lifting and moving equipment in\ngood repair and with adequate capacity\nto prevent injuries to personnel or damage to equipment.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:1",
      null,
      [
        "S011"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P044",
      "Suction and discharge hoses and piping must be removed from the pump before lifting.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:1",
      null,
      [
        "S011"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P045",
      "After the pump has been positioned,\nmake certain that the pump and all piping or hose connections are tight, properly supported and secure before operation.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:1",
      null,
      [
        "S011"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P046",
      "Do not operate the pump against a\nclosed discharge valve for long periods\nof time.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:1",
      null,
      [
        "S011"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P047",
      "If operated against a closed discharge valve, pump components will\ndeteriorate, and the liquid could come\nPAGE A -- 1",
      true,
      "prose",
      "4:column:1",
      null,
      [
        "S011"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P048",
      "SAFETY - SECTION A",
      true,
      "heading",
      "4:column:2",
      null,
      []
    ]
